check metric server installation on both the clusters:
==================================================

before install check cluster collecting node level metrics or not: you will not get an ouput

kubectl --context monitoring-eks   get pods -n kube-system
kubectl --context monitoring-eks top nodes

kubectl --context application-eks   get pods -n kube-system
kubectl --context application-eks top nodes
